{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36888","headline":"官池秋夕 · 罗隐","name":"官池秋夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池边月影闲婆娑，池上醉来成短歌。\n芙渠抵死怨珠露，蟋蟀苦口嫌金波。\n往事向人言不得，旧游临老恨空多。\n松醪作酒兰爲棹，十载烟尘奈尔何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}